      ro: ["Fortăreața Surami a fost construită în secolul al XII-lea.", "Se află la 760 m deasupra nivelului mării.", "Zidurile au o grosime de până la 3 metri.", "Cetatea are un diametru de aproximativ 50 de metri.", "În secolul al XVII-lea a fost cucerită de otomani.", "Fortăreața are 4 turnuri."],
      en: ["Surami Fortress was built in the 12th century.", "It is located at 760 meters above sea level.", "The walls are up to 3 meters thick.", "The citadel has a diameter of about 50 meters.", "It was captured by the Ottomans in the 17th century.", "The fortress has 4 towers."],
